WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:05.038
The ghouls and freaks
are on the prowl.

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:08.608
I need sweets and treats to stop
my stomach growl.

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:11.044
I haven't thrown a
Halloween party...

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:12.712
in a minute!

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:14.514
I want this to be one
for the history books.
You understand me?

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:19.185
You know my Halloween queen will
be throwing this party with me.

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:21.521
I'll pick the best
baking talent.

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:23.490
I want dozens and
dozens of treats.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.960
I want a fortress of fondant!

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.928
Everything I do has to be big.

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:30.797
Ha ha ha!

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:34.868
Welcome to our Tasty Manor.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:36.369
Oh!

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.138
Ready to make my Halloween
nightmares a reality?

00:00:38.138 --> 00:00:39.406
Ha ha ha!

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:41.474
Halloween is one of
my favorite holidays.

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:42.742
Are you up to it?

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:44.577
Yes! Yes!

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:47.647
From Buzzfeed's "Tasty,"
Alvin Zhou!

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:49.249
That is insane.

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:52.385
This is the most crazy baking
kitchen I've ever been in.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.721
It takes a lot to
meet my expectations.

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:55.588
Boy do I know!

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:56.689
Ha ha ha!

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:58.291
No more wasting time.

00:01:01.995 --> 00:01:03.363
Ready to have some fun?

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:05.865
Oh, that's spooky!

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:07.600
Really creepy.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.636
I'm just shocked that so
much of this is edible.

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:11.404
Everything is edible!

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:14.541
Get out of there Alvin!

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:15.608
Heh, they got Snoop's fingers.

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:16.910
What is going on, man?!

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.478
That is our chocolate gateau.

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:21.448
Oh, let's see what this
ghetto chocolate's working with.

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:23.883
You said you wanted a party.

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:29.022
Snoop, you're slouching.

00:01:29.022 --> 00:01:30.790
She's the only one that
can train this Dogg.

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:32.759
Ha ha ha!

